            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 219,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "1. Do we have RPU leak status exposed on RMC via a GPIO?\n2. We should name this better - probably RPU1LeakPort1, RPU1LeakPort2 and so on. @patrick@stwcx.xyz Any better ideas on nomenclature?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 219,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "P. K. Lee",
                        "email": "p.k.lee@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "PKLee-Quanta"
                    },
                    "message": "Since the RMC can only detect the AALC's status via the RPU_READY_* pins provided by the AALC, and leakage is just one of the abnormal conditions, should we then rename them to RPU1LeakPort1, RPU1LeakPort2, and so on?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 219,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "P. K. Lee",
                        "email": "p.k.lee@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "PKLee-Quanta"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 259,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Can you please name these based on leak sensors, for example for \"RackDripPan\" leak, name the corresponding cable port as \"RackDripPanPort\" and so on to they can mapped appropriately."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 259,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "P. K. Lee",
                        "email": "p.k.lee@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "PKLee-Quanta"
                    },
                    "message": "Understood. I will submit a patchset based on your current suggestions."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 259,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "P. K. Lee",
